    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncle Unco</strong> is the cutest, fluffiest, most lovable character who just can\u2019t catch a break...<br>or his bus!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Will Uncle Unco make it to the bus on time? That\u2019s up to you!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106560/extras/2492c80dd3c5029ad9bc53b021104b92.poster.avif?t=1734185630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106560/extras/2492c80dd3c5029ad9bc53b021104b92.webm?t=1734185630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106560/extras/2492c80dd3c5029ad9bc53b021104b92.mp4?t=1734185630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Fun:</strong> Dodge hazards with a unique control system and race to the bus stop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art:</strong> Enjoy stunning visuals with a nostalgic pop-up book feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Challenging:</strong> Easy to pick up, but offers more for those seeking to master the movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Accessible:</strong> Free to play, with full controller support for a seamless experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy To Play, Hard to Master</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appeal</strong> - casual players, speed-runners and completionists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage\u00a0</strong>- great for all audiences and streamers to rage at!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Feel</strong> - smooth yet goofy controls make it hilarious yet unique.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Indie Game Community </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an award winning game and a hidden gem in the indie game scene.<br><br><i>A jonniemadeit game</i> </p>",
